1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,926
Pricing is not a personality test. Scope first. Then a number you can actually deliver on.

2
00:00:06,326 --> 00:00:10,400
Four steps. One: one-sentence outcome. What they have when you finish.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,985
Two: honest hours plus a sustainable floor rate. Include the boring admin and waiting.

4
00:00:16,385 --> 00:00:23,422
Three: risk buffer of twenty to forty percent. Four: clean number and one sentence why it protects the result.

5
00:00:23,822 --> 00:00:32,711
That is it. Write the number. Put it on the offer. Send it. Adjust after real data, not after panic. Details in the description.

